Tools > Built-in: Lead Capture

The `LeadCaptureTool` lets the AI collect contact information from conversations:

```typescript
import { LeadCaptureTool } from '@chatcops/core';

const leadTool = new LeadCaptureTool(async (lead) => {
  console.log('New lead:', lead);
  // Save to database, CRM, send webhook, etc.
});
```
</source>
<source id="2" url="https://chat.codercops.com/server/express/" title="Express Adapter" section="With Lead Capture">
Express Adapter > With Lead Capture

```typescript
import { LeadCaptureTool } from '@chatcops/core';
import express from 'express';
import { chatcopsMiddleware } from '@chatcops/server';

const app = express();
const db = { leads: { create: async (_lead: unknown) => {} } };

app.all('/chat', chatcopsMiddleware({
  provider: {
    type: 'claude',
    apiKey: process.env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY!,
  },
  systemPrompt: 'You are a helpful assistant. Capture leads when users share contact info.',
  tools: [
    new LeadCaptureTool(async (lead) => {
      // Save to your database, CRM, etc.
      await db.leads.create(lead);
      console.log('Lead captured:', lead.email);
    }),
  ],
}));
```
</source>
